    MAKEPRI_STRING_CREATES_PRI_FILE_AT_OUTPUTFILE_BY "    Creates a PRI file at [outputfile] by indexing all files in the\n    [projectroot]and its subdirectories as directed by the [configxml]. The\n    index will be assigned [indexname] to reference resources in the application"
