    MAKEPRI_STRING_MAKEPRI_EXE_VERSIONED_CREATES_VERSIONED_PRI "    MakePri.exe versioned creates a versioned PRI file at [outputfile] by\n    indexing all files in the [projectroot] and its subdirectories based on\n    [indexfile] and as directed by the [configxml]."
